    "午休算带薪时间。弹性工时可以稍后在设置里打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lunch counts as paid time. You can turn on flexible hours later in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参考值只是中高收入的粗略综合扣除率（税加社保），实际请按自己的工资条调整。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presets are rough combined rates (tax plus social contributions) for mid-to-high incomes. Adjust to match your own payslip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
