        }
      }
    },
    "地区决定默认的节假日日历、货币和参考物价，之后都可以改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Region sets the default holiday calendar, currency and reference prices. You can change all of them later."
