      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "实时活动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live Activity"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "实时活动上的金额只在窝囊费有机会运行时刷新，大约几分钟一次，旁边的“截至”时间表示数字的新旧。要每分钟准确的金额，请用锁屏或桌面小组件。自动显示需要你偶尔打开一次窝囊费来预约之后几个工作日。非固定工时模式下，系统会在 8 小时后结束实时活动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Live Activity amount refreshes only when WageDrip gets to run, about every few minutes; the “As of” time shows how fresh it is. For an amount accurate to the minute, use a Lock Screen or Home Screen widget. Automatic display needs you to open WageDrip now and then so it can schedule the next few workdays. With flexible hours, the system ends the Live Activity after 8 hours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
