    "非固定工时": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flexible hours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "非固定工时适合没有固定上下班时间的项目制：上下班之间拿到大部分日薪，剩下的在下班后到午夜之间匀速计入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flexible hours suit salaried work without fixed times: most of the day's pay accrues between start and end, and the rest accrues evenly from then until midnight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认价格只是粗略参考，按你身边的物价改。左滑可删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default prices are rough references. Change them to match prices near you. Swipe left to delete."
          }
        }
      }
    }
